---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(224,237,215) Opponent
    participant W as White player
    end
    box rgb(241,245,249) Game controller
    participant L as Lucas Chess
    end
    box rgb(219,232,251) UCI engine
    participant R as Remus (Black)
    end
    Note over W,R: Alternative endings to a ponder request after 1. f3 e5, g4 is predicted.
    L->>R: position startpos moves f2f3 e7e5 g2g4
    L->>R: go ponder wtime 59000 btime 59000
    alt Standard UCI hit: White plays g4
        W->>L: g2g4
        L->>R: ponderhit
        R->>R: Keep the search, start own-clock budget
        R-->>L: bestmove d8h4
        L->>L: Play Qh4 (checkmate), record 0-1
    else Miss: White plays e4 instead
        W->>L: e2e4
        L->>R: stop
        R-->>L: bestmove d8h4
        Note over L,R: Discard this hypothetical-position result. Do not play Qh4 here.
        L->>R: position startpos moves f2f3 e7e5 e2e4
        L->>R: go wtime 57000 btime 59000
        R->>R: Search actual position, no ponder time credit
        R-->>L: bestmove b8c6 ponder b1c3
        L->>L: Play Nc6, continue the game
    end
